      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاتَ عَبْطَةً</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, S, O) <i>died in a sound,</i>
or <i>healthy, state, and being a youth,</i> or <i>young
man.</i> (S, O, Msb, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبْطَةٌ</span> also signifies
(tropical:)  <i>Evil speech of another; detraction; defamation.</i>
